N:played as 8 semi-quavers.
N:NB2 = Under these bars is written "Si lon trouve le passage trop difficile on peut le jouer
N:simple", which I translate as "If you find this passage too difficult you may play it simply."
N:Of course this remark could equally well refer to those bars underneath it in the MS,
N:which I have marked NB3
